  "ruleText": "Fis 307.04 Wild Turkey. No person shall use the aid of bait to take wild turkeys in any open season.\n\nSource. #8931, eff 7-6-07; ss by #10142, eff 6-5-12; ss by #10619, eff 6-2-14 (from Fis 307.03); ss by #13211, eff 5-26-21",
